<title>UK: Stagecoach sells Norwegian unit Swebus.</title>
<headline>Stagecoach sells Norwegian unit Swebus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British transport group Stagecoach Holdings Plc said on Wednesday it sold Swebus Norge AS to Norgebuss Invest AS for a total of 7.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Swebus, the holding company for Stagecoach's Norwegian operations, runs a total of 250 buses in central Norway. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
